  "ingredients": [
    "0.25 cup white sugar",
    "1.5 teaspoons kosher salt",
    "1 teaspoon cayenne pepper",
    "2.5 cups whole almonds",
    "1 tablespoon water",
    "1 tablespoon honey",
    "1 teaspoon olive oil"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat an oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Spread the almonds onto a baking sheet, and toast until the nuts start to turn golden brown and become fragrant, about 10 minutes. Watch the nuts carefully as they bake: they burn quickly.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/N1mIkyex9Ch8aCSHBp6A774svIs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/171151-sweet-and-spicy-almonds-DDMFS-step-02-f0c6ba0babec445aa00838a39bc7d794.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/171151/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir together the sugar, salt, and cayenne pepper in a mixing bowl; set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/XX5zOxYk1rVgC1tW7bY_tz-S0XY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/171151-sweet-and-spicy-almonds-DDMFS-step-03-51d85e94b2634767815909dd6d510983.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/171151/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir together the water, honey, and olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat. Once the mixture begins to bubble, stir in the toasted almonds until evenly moistened.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/g2taxutLe9n6Mm144-6jf_aJcd4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/171151-sweet-and-spicy-almonds-DDMFS-step-04-ce3549f0aa774824bcfdcd7fa0b7b723.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/171151/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour the almonds into the sugar and spice mixture, and toss until evenly coated.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/AIGDBRKYSpgTzVlYA_8i23uoSRk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/171151-sweet-and-spicy-almonds-DDMFS-step-05-687acda5bceb439e8a793c4d37612a99.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/171151/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread onto baking sheets in a single layer, and cool to room temperature.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/uWgUfOTGMVMKvPHlk_0uIM1Vlb8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/171151-sweet-and-spicy-almonds-DDMFS-step-06-5037d050c7964af78cc811e0df26b401.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/171151/step_06.webp"
    }
